{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04571","headline":"至尉氏 · 张说","name":"至尉氏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夕次阮公台，啸歌临爽垲。\n高名安足赖，故物今皆改。\n吾兄昔兹邑，遗爱称贤宰。\n桑中雉未飞，屋上乌犹在。\n途逢旧甿吏，城有同僚寀。\n望尘远见迎，拂馆来欣待。\n慈惠留千室，友于存四海。\n始知鲁衞间，优劣相悬倍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}